  {
   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Chat Review Typed\n\nA headline with the shop name on its own line, a customer's avatar and name, an incoming bubble with typing dots that then writes the review letter by letter, a dark reply bubble sliding in from the right, five stars with a score line, and a call-to-action pill. White page, hairline bubbles.\n\nCategory: commerce. Length: 10 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- A customer review, a viewer comment or a student message should be shown as proof.\n- A short message (up to about 110 characters) that is worth reading as it is typed.\n\nAvoid when:\n- A long text or several reviews: use one block per review, or a testimonial card layout.\n- You need the look of a specific messaging app: this is a generic bubble chat.\n\nVariables:\n- headline_lead (string): Headline lead, default \"Kata mereka tentang\"\n- subject (string): Subject, default \"Kue Rumahan Bunda\"\n- customer_name (string): Customer name, default \"Bu Sari\"\n- customer_note (string): Customer note, default \"pelanggan sejak 2023\"\n- review (string): Review, default \"Kue lapisnya lembut banget, anak-anak sampai rebutan. Minggu depan pesan lagi ya!\"\n- reply (string): Reply, default \"Terima kasih, Bu Sari! Ditunggu pesanannya\"\n- score_text (string): Score line, default \"4,9 dari 1.200+ ulasan\"\n- cta (string): Call to action, default \"Pesan: 0812-3456-7890\"\n- bg_color (color): Background, default \"#ffffff\"\n- surface_color (color): Bubble colour, default \"#fafafa\"\n- main_color (color): Main colour, default \"#2563eb\"\n- text_color (color): Text colour, default \"#0a0a0a\"\n- muted_color (color): Muted colour, default \"#737373\"\n- star_color (color): Star colour, default \"#f59e0b\"\n- transparent (boolean): Transparent, default false\n\nSource: Mosio original. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
